# ReactOS C and C++ style

Follow [CODING_STYLE.md](CODING_STYLE.md) and [.clang-format](.clang-format).

- Indent with 4 spaces. Braces go on their own lines. Keep lines to 100 characters.
- New and edited files use the header in [file-headers.mdc](file-headers.mdc). That rule chooses GPL-2.0-or-later or LGPL-2.1-or-later and keeps the original copyright lines.
- Do not reformat a file in the same commit as a behavior change. A formatting-only commit starts with `[FORMATTING]`.
- Do not reformat files listed in `media/doc/WINESYNC.txt` or `media/doc/3rd Party Files.txt`.

```c
/* Right */
if (Status == STATUS_SUCCESS)
{
    CompleteRequest(Irp);
}
```
